      <definition>1[= bodu, 2.] n, Large cattle (such as horses, . cows, camels); unit of livestock equal to 1 cow or ox, 1 horse, 1/2 a camel, 7 sheep, or 14 goats; chessmen (excluding king and pawns).</definition>
